      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PHAROAH SHOW (1) disappointed last time out in the Broome Cup after some strong performances prior to that. Coming back to this trip is no issue and Murray's claim is a big tick. Can bounce back to his best form here which would see him very hard to hold out. STAR TESTYMONY (6) missed narrowly last start at Broome and has been scratched since. The form out of his last start was solid though and Li's claim means he gets in right down in the weights. Drops back in trip today but can make his presence felt. HARD QUESTIONS (2) is trending the right way, finishing 2.5L clear of his rivals over the mile last time out. Faithfull hopping on board today is a big tick and he maps to get every chance. Can bring up the hat-trick in this suitable assignment. LOMBADINA (4) was better last time and can't be discounted on her best form. RED REBEL (3) is racing well and can make every post a winner from the front.",
